    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "It's interesting, you know, of course we now do politics everywhere all the time. I was talking to my boss Mark the other day and he was asking me about something along those lines, a little further back. And I remember what I said was, you know, one of the great things about America is we sometimes, not sometimes, one of the great things about America is we often give up and move on. One of the awful things about America is we often give up and move on. Some things need to stay a",
