    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86959.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 41,
    "turn_text": "Okay. All right. Well, we're excited that you are now going to represent us with your principles and your conservative leadership at the county supervisors. I want to talk to you a little bit about some of the stuff you're probably hearing on the ground with regard to the border and illegal immigration. But before we do that, you know, it's a funny thing. The Maricopa County supervisors It's a heck of an interesting job. It's got a lot of purview. Do you want to say a word about what that job entails?",
